{"id":"a5f677e465ed7833","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-k4-transitive-complete.md","title":"K4 Completeness on Transitive Frames","display":"prop-k4-transitive-complete — K4 Completeness on Transitive Frames","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-k4-transitive-complete","aliases":["89-prop-k4-transitive-complete"],"display":"prop-k4-transitive-complete — K4 Completeness on Transitive Frames","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","[[89-thm-convergence-completeness]]","[[89-prop-convergence-special-cases]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-k4-transitive-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-k4-transitive-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-k4-transitive-complete — K4 Completeness on Transitive Frames"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"852a0356bca26d3a\" href=\"?note=852a0356bca26d3a\" title=\"89-thm-convergence-completeness\">89-thm-convergence-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fcabe060a57a2a7b\" href=\"?note=fcabe060a57a2a7b\" title=\"89-prop-convergence-special-cases\">89-prop-convergence-special-cases</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 遍历非空 Kripke 框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}(F)\\)</span> 表示传递性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\models A\">\\(F\\models A\\)</span> 为框架有效性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}k4\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{K4}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\;(\\mathrm{Trans}(F)\\to F\\models A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}k4\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{K4}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\;(\\mathrm{Trans}(F)\\to F\\models A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 89–90；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=\\{(0,2,1,0)\\}\">\\(a=\\{(0,2,1,0)\\}\\)</span>。额外收敛模式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\to\\Box^2 A\">\\(\\Box A\\to\\Box^2 A\\)</span>，故最小正规逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K_a\">\\(\\mathrm K_a\\)</span> 恰是 K4；框架收敛恰是传递性。一般收敛完全性立即给结论。不限有限框架，也不要求逆良基。原书另在第 5 章提供有限 K4 完全性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k4","status":"resolved","id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-convergence-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"852a0356bca26d3a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-convergence-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-prop-convergence-special-cases","status":"resolved","id":"fcabe060a57a2a7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-prop-convergence-special-cases]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{K4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}k4\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{K4}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\;(\\mathrm{Trans}(F)\\to F\\models A).","display":true},{"tex":"a=\\{(0,2,1,0)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\to\\Box^2 A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm K_a","display":false}],"bytes":1247,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-576","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-prop-k4-transitive-complete]]"}],"outgoing":["d9f30bc0c9c793d3","852a0356bca26d3a","fcabe060a57a2a7b","dbba58e7bd3b0667"]}